 * Returns indices of elements whose values lie within a specified inclusive range
 * @param {number[]} sequence - The array to search
 * @param {number} minBound - The minimum value (inclusive)
 * @param {number} maxBound - The maximum value (inclusive)
 * @returns {number[]} Array of indices where values are within range
