  console.log("Verification: xy =", (x * y).toFixed(10));
  console.log("Verification: x² + y² =", (x*x + y*y).toFixed(10));
}
```

## Key Features

✅ **Newton-Raphson Method** - Fast quadratic convergence for well-behaved systems  
✅ **Jacobian Matrix** - Uses 2×2 Jacobian for linear system solving  
✅ **Convergence Tracking** - Monitors iteration history  
