 * @param {pl.DataFrame} df0 - The input DataFrame
 * @param {string} columnName - Name of the source column
 * @param {number} val0 - The threshold value
 * @param {string} label_high - Label for values > threshold
 * @param {string} label_low - Label for values <= threshold
 * @returns {pl.DataFrame} - DataFrame with new 'col0' column
