 * Assigns unique integer codes to distinct values in table columns
 * @param {Object} table - Object with var0 and var1 arrays
 * @param {Array} table.var0 - First column data
 * @param {Array} table.var1 - Second column data
 * @returns {Object} Object with lst0 and lst1 containing coded values
